@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 0. Login (Wajib 200 + token) — chaining utk semua request di bawah.
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "satnaing", "password": "widuri2026" }

@token = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### 1. POST /kmeans/runs — eksekusi K-Means pertama (Wajib 201; oracle moves [105,14,7,2,0])
# Guard 422 (KASUS: reduced_data run aktif KOSONG):
#   bila preprocessing belum sampai tahap Reduksi -> 422
#   "Data reduksi belum tersedia; jalankan preprocessing sampai tahap Reduksi."
POST {{baseUrl}}/kmeans/runs?periodeId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. POST /kmeans/runs KEDUA — kasus 409 (Wajib 409 Bahasa Indonesia)
# Lock DERIVED: sudah ada kmeans_run status COMPLETED utk periode ini ->
#   409 "K-Means sudah pernah dijalankan pada periode ini; data siswa terkunci."
# TIDAK ada kolom lock di siswa_periode (R-KM-27); derivasi via eksistensi run.
POST {{baseUrl}}/kmeans/runs?periodeId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. GET /kmeans/runs/latest — summary+iterations+assignments (Wajib 200; 105 assignments clusterIndex 0-9)
GET {{baseUrl}}/kmeans/runs/latest?periodeId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. GET centroids iterasi 1 — accordion 8E (Wajib 200; 10 baris x 25 fitur string 4 desimal)
GET {{baseUrl}}/kmeans/runs/latest/iterations/1/centroids?periodeId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Pipeline-status pasca run — bukti lockedByKmeans TRUE (derivasi R-KM-31, tanpa kolom baru)
GET {{baseUrl}}/preprocessing/pipeline-status?periodeId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
